<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Royal Dutch Petroleum.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Royal Dutch Petroleum.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corporation has issued 500,000 American-style call warrants on Royal Dutch Petroleum Company, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    230 DFL		   PREMIUM	3.24 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     24.44 CHF		 GEARING	7.55 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	15.OCT.97		 PAYDATE	06.SEP.96</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  255.60 DFL		MIN EXER LOT ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
